"SECTOR" "TYPES"

 0  indoors
 1  city/road
 2  fields
 3  forest
 4  hills
 5  mountains
 6  water (swimmable)
 7  river (non-swimmable)
 8  air
 9  water
10  desert
11  inside tree (for druid tree travel)
12  dark city/road

